WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.390
Getting funded with Lamp. Part one: applying.

2
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:10.640
Your Lamp rep texts or emails you a link. It opens your application, with your rep's name on it.

3
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.780
It takes about ten minutes, and costs nothing.

4
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:21.800
Start with your name, mobile and email, so your rep can help if you get stuck. Then press Start my application.

5
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:35.690
There are six steps: your business, the owners, real estate, the funding you want, statements, and review and sign.

6
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:40.110
It saves as you go. You can stop, and come back any time.

7
00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.890
At the end you sign right on the page. The signed application goes straight to your rep.

8
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:51.970
Prefer paper? Your rep can send the one-page version. You fill it in and sign it the same way.

9
00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.420
Next: your account.
